msgid ""
"# Email setup for {{display_name}}\n"
"\n"
"Use these settings if your email program does not configure itself\n"
"automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Your email address: {{email_address}}\n"
"\n"
"## Incoming mail\n"
"\n"
"| Setting | Value |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Server type | {{incoming.type}} |\n"
"| Server name | {{incoming.hostname}} |\n"
"| Port | {{incoming.port}} |\n"
"| Connection security | {{incoming.socket_type}} |\n"
"| Authentication | {{incoming.authentication}} |\n"
"| Username | {{incoming.username}} |\n"
"\n"
"## Outgoing mail\n"
"\n"
"| Setting | Value |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Server type | {{outgoing.type}} |\n"
"| Server name | {{outgoing.hostname}} |\n"
"| Port | {{outgoing.port}} |\n"
"| Connection security | {{outgoing.socket_type}} |\n"
"| Authentication | {{outgoing.authentication}} |\n"
"| Username | {{outgoing.username}} |\n"
"\n"
"Use your normal email password when the email program asks for a password.\n"
msgstr ""
"# E-postoppsett for {{display_name}}\n"
"\n"
"Bruk disse innstillingene hvis e-postprogrammet ditt ikke setter opp kontoen\n"
"automatisk.\n"
"\n"
"Din e-postadresse: {{email_address}}\n"
"\n"
"## Innkommende e-post\n"
"\n"
"| Innstilling | Verdi |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Servertype | {{incoming.type}} |\n"
"| Servernavn | {{incoming.hostname}} |\n"
"| Port | {{incoming.port}} |\n"
"| Tilkoblingssikkerhet | {{incoming.socket_type}} |\n"
"| Autentisering | {{incoming.authentication}} |\n"
"| Brukernavn | {{incoming.username}} |\n"
"\n"
"## Utgående e-post\n"
"\n"
"| Innstilling | Verdi |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Servertype | {{outgoing.type}} |\n"
"| Servernavn | {{outgoing.hostname}} |\n"
"| Port | {{outgoing.port}} |\n"
"| Tilkoblingssikkerhet | {{outgoing.socket_type}} |\n"
"| Autentisering | {{outgoing.authentication}} |\n"
"| Brukernavn | {{outgoing.username}} |\n"
"\n"
"Bruk ditt vanlige e-postpassord når e-postprogrammet spør etter passord.\n"
